00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:36.090
So let me run that.

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:41.250
So what is doing now--
so it is a simple query

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.860
to scanning all
the 10 billion rows

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.310
to find out all the
rows with the word

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:52.780
Google inside title by using
