00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.800
And usually, if you
write this kind of query,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:59.220
that requires [INAUDIBLE]
scanning or table scan

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.570
of your table.

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.920
That means you have to read
